    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know therapy helps with feelings but it doesn't change the reality. my stress, my lack of money, the way i just crawl into bed exhausted every night... it all trickles down to them. i see it in their faces. they're growing up in this constant fog of my struggle. it feels less like i'm \"struggling\" and more like i'm just actively dragging them down with me. like i'm an anchor.",
